WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.981
Access to a senior person can be mistaken for

00:00:03.007 --> 00:00:08.744
authority We know the intended result Now identify who

00:00:08.771 --> 00:00:12.639
may contribute and who must decide People may ask

00:00:12.639 --> 00:00:15.692
an assistant to decide because the assistant works close

00:00:15.757 --> 00:00:20.020
to the executive That can be helpful access but

00:00:20.046 --> 00:00:23.336
it does not transfer a finance legal or protection

00:00:23.336 --> 00:00:27.942
mandate We will compare actual responsibilities rather than rank

00:00:27.981 --> 00:00:33.165
job titles A personal assistant PA may have overlapping

00:00:33.231 --> 00:00:37.021
support responsibilities the actual work and permission must be

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.678
agreed rather than inferred from either title
